**Description of the Terraform Program:**

This Terraform configuration creates a basic AWS CodeBuild project that builds from a GitHub repository. It includes an IAM role that grants the necessary permissions for CodeBuild to access the GitHub repository and perform build actions. The configuration uses default values for variables such as the GitHub repository URL, buildspec file, and environment settings, making it easy to deploy and customize.

---

**Terraform HCL Program:**

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "codebuild_role" {
  name = "codebuild-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [{
      Effect = "Allow"
      Principal = {
        Service = "codebuild.amazonaws.com"
      }
      Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
    }]
  })
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment" "codebuild_basic" {
  role       = aws_iam_role.codebuild_role.name
  policy_arn = "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AWSCodeBuildBasicPolicy"
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment" "codebuild_github" {
  role       = aws_iam_role.codebuild_role.name
  policy_arn = "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AmazonEC2ContainerRegistryPowerUser"
}

resource "aws_codebuild_project" "example" {
  name          = "example-codebuild-project"
  description   = "Example CodeBuild project using GitHub as source"
  source {
    type            = "GITHUB"
    location        = "https://github.com/example/example-repo.git"
    branch          = "main"
    buildspec       = "buildspec.yml"
    git_clone_depth = 1
  }

  environment {
    type                = "LINUX_CONTAINER"
    image               = "aws/codebuild/amazonlinux2-x86_64-standard:3.0"
    compute_type        = "BUILD_GENERAL1_SMALL"
    environment_variable {
      name  = "GITHUB_TOKEN"
      value = "your_github_token_here"
    }
  }

  service_role = aws_iam_role.codebuild_role.arn

  artifacts {
    type = "NO_ARTIFACTS"
  }

  timeout_in_minutes = 10
}
```

---

**Notes:**

- Replace `"your_github_token_here"` with a valid GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT) with `repo` scope.
- The GitHub repository URL should be replaced with your actual repository.
- The `buildspec.yml` file should exist in the root of your GitHub repository and define the build steps.
- The IAM role grants CodeBuild the ability to access GitHub and interact with AWS services like ECR (if needed).

